#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/metal/language/kernel/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Code inside the launch operates at the threadgroup level: ``T.Parallel``, "
"``T.copy`` and friends are mapped onto threads by the compiler. ``T."
"get_thread_binding()`` exposes the thread index for thread-level code. The "
"keyword arguments are recorded at trace time and materialized by the Metal "
"pipeline once the target is known."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/metal/language/kernel/index.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/metal/language/kernel/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Grid extent along each axis (1-3 dimensions). The launch yields one "
"threadgroup index per axis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/metal/language/kernel/index.rst:36
msgid ""
"Threads per threadgroup: a count or up to three per-dimension extents. "
"Defaults to 128 when omitted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/metal/language/kernel/index.rst:39
msgid ""
